28:["$","div",null,{"className":"pb-4 pt-0 text-muted-foreground leading-relaxed","children":"Yes. The Upanishads form the final section of the Vedas, known as Vedanta (the end of the Veda). While the early parts of the Vedas focus on rituals and hymns (Karma Kanda), the Upanishads focus entirely on philosophical inquiry and self-knowledge (Jnana Kanda)."}]
